      "id": "house_business_case_001",
      "project_id": "house_construction_project_001",
      "problem_statement": "The current housing market lacks affordable, energy-efficient single-family homes that meet modern sustainability standards while providing comfortable living spaces for growing families",
      "business_objectives": [
        "Construct a high-quality residential property that increases neighborhood property values",
        "Demonstrate sustainable building practices that reduce environmental impact",
        "Create a model home for future construction projects in the area",
        "Generate positive community impact through quality construction",
        "Establish reputation as a reliable residential construction company"
      ],
      "benefits": [
        "25-30% reduction in energy costs for homeowners through efficient design",
        "Increased property value appreciation compared to standard construction",
        "Reduced environmental footprint through sustainable materials and practices",
        "Enhanced indoor air quality and occupant health",
        "Long-term durability and reduced maintenance costs",
        "Potential for tax incentives and green building certifications"
      ],
      "costs": "Estimated total project cost: $425,000 (including land acquisition, materials, labor, permits, and contingencies)",
      "roi_analysis": "Expected ROI: 15-20% upon completion and sale, with potential for higher returns if held as rental property. Energy savings provide ongoing operational ROI of 8-10% annually",
      "alternatives_analysis": "Alternative 1: Standard construction - lower upfront cost but higher operating expenses\nAlternative 2: Luxury construction - higher quality but significantly higher budget\nAlternative 3: Modular/prefab construction - faster timeline but limited customization\nSelected approach balances quality, sustainability, and budget constraints",
      "recommendation": "Proceed with the energy-efficient residential construction project as it aligns with market demand, sustainability goals, and provides competitive financial returns while establishing our company as a leader in green building practices",
      "approval_status": "Proposed",
      "approved_date": null,
      "__type__": "BusinessCase"
